# Vite 7 Asset Pipeline Rules

- **Vite 7 Integration**: Use `@tailwindcss/vite` and `laravel-vite-plugin`.
- **Blade Inclusion**: Use `@vite(['resources/css/app.css', 'resources/js/app.js'])`.
- **Clean Builds**: Run `npm run build` to verify manifests and bundle generation before any release.
- **Asset Links**: Never hardcode asset URLs. Use `asset()` helper or `@vite` directive.
